From 4d748d7801de6fa24e2ee4d9569e815c3873416e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shakked Zucker <shakkedz@campus.technion.ac.il>
Date: Mon, 25 May 2026 11:11:49 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] ping: add ICMPv6 reflection options

Add -z to send an ICMPv6 Extended Echo Request containing a
Reflect All object.

Add -x to print the reflected payload returned in the Reflect All
object as a hex dump. Store the send timestamp by sequence number so
RTT calculation continues to work when the normal ping payload is used
as a reflection placeholder.

The new options are intended for IPv6 reflection diagnostics.

Signed-off-by: Shakked Zucker <shakkedz@campus.technion.ac.il>
---
